# === LuZ-0.1.7-DSV41F R0 gate (2026-09-17) ===
# secrets / runtime state
.env
.env.tp4
.env.tp4.*
!.env.tp4.example
state/
state-tp4/
logs/
logs-tp4/
*.bak*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# backups live OUTSIDE the repo (~/r0-backup-*/), never commit them

# scratch / tooling state. Added 2026-09-18: this directory is where a leak scan's
# own output lands, and that output quotes every hit verbatim -- an unignored scratch
# directory is how such a file reaches a commit. It is also not covered by the R0
# gate above, since it neither is nor looks like a secret-store path.
.workbuddy/

# runtime benchmark artifacts (per-stream records, engine logs). Added 2026-09-19:
# may contain prompts / model outputs; published figures ship under data/ instead.
bench-results/

# investigation-arm env snapshots. Added 2026-09-24: start.sh's own recipe for
# trying a different configuration is `cp .env.tp4 .env.tp4-<label>` and then
# `ENV_FILE=.env.tp4-<label> ./start.sh ...`. The `.env.tp4.*` rule above uses a
# dot, so those hyphenated copies were NOT ignored -- and a copy of .env.tp4
# carries API_KEY. The rule below closes that path. (The deployment root has had
# it since 2026-09-21; the omission was public-side only.)
.env.tp4-*

# 过期 overlay 快照：把旧 overlay 移出树时留下的 `sglang-overlay.stale-<date>/`
# 不应入库（部署根自 2026-09-21 起就有这条规则；公开仓同样带 sglang-overlay/，
# 因此同样适用 —— 那是 49 个文件的目录，混入一份过期副本会很难看出来）。
sglang-overlay.stale-*/
